# Run L (2026-11-07, user: "increase temperature learning rate"): run K two-town
# (slurm/il_finetune_c0_sac_per_priv_2t.env: pure SAC + PER + privileged critic,
# speed rule kept, Town05 + Town01 live) with the SAC temperature learning rate
# raised from the critic's 3e-4 (ALPHA_LR 0 = follow LR) to 1e-2.
#
# Why that value: Adam moves log(alpha) about ALPHA_LR per update. At 3e-4 run K's
# temperature fell only 0.100 -> 0.079 over the ~400 actor updates in which it
# collapsed (policy .80 -> .04; actor entropy ~1.35 nats, near-uniform, against
# the -2.0 target). At 1e-2 it can fall ~10x within ~200 actor updates, inside
# that window. Caveat on record: run C started at temperature 0.001 and its
# noise still jumped, so the temperature alone may not hold the clone.
# Target entropy stays -2.0 (TARGET_ENTROPY default).
. "$REPO/slurm/il_finetune_c0_sac_per_priv_2t.env"
export ALPHA_LR=0.01
